<title>PORTUGAL: Cimpor sets out privatisation calendar.</title>
<headline>Cimpor sets out privatisation calendar.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is the calendar for the privatisation of a further tranche of state-controlled Cimpor-Cimentos de Portugal :</p>
<p>Sept 20 - Publication of prospectus</p>
<p>Sept 23 - Opening of pre-registration</p>
<p>Sept 25 - Road-show begins</p>
<p>Oct  4  - End of pre-registration</p>
<p>Oct  7  - Start of the public offer to sell (OPV)</p>
<p>Oct  11 - Road-show ends</p>
<p>Oct  15 - Price and allocation of shares announced on the Lisbon bourse</p>
<p>Oct  16 - Shares admitted for trade on the Lisbon bourse</p>
<p>Oct  18 - Shares admitted for trade in London and New York</p>
<p>--Paula Cordeiro, Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
